{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_04_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e3b6304f56e20142af847b60eb087c50d3a9b8dcc7d4937fc3c49e76b470ed0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:652ceb7650af9856d683d9d31ba94e86c4bb5f92da4302ef6b69fe6f623fd6b3",
      "text": "今天长时间辛苦大家了。\n关于试镜的结果，两位都合格了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1a5e9b466d4d66b0d660e18186c3a8f3db1e45874a0de7f7fc87f4397118566",
      "text": "真的吗！太好了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e66eadbdda889b2f9ff6511d39758bb1865121ebc90b27c3256562d9a7ef7efe",
      "text": "非常感谢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f5e62f71fae711a4b861cec14e3b03ec403b94e24df1e852d13ccdf9d566c19",
      "text": "从今往后我们就在同一个职场工作了呢。\n请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dcfc8da63a1154932c822511b4f28a51d875b30aebfd44c4ce0a73dbf1bd844",
      "text": "呵呵，是呢～。既然要长期相处，\n相处时就可以免去麻烦的客套和场面话了吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:502ded5298150c9ca9ef3f10f9ae389dcca2c675e58612df1784f96f2c0808e6",
      "text": "是啊！我也希望能这样呢。\n见人说人话见鬼说鬼话什么的，我本就不擅长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3628c94634fb608e832b24ff1af3a1e3cbffcad21d3db7f063ab95f1a00cb5ae",
      "text": "话说回来，能赶上试镜真是太好了。\n要是从那栋楼前走过的话，可就危险了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:349ece5bb826efa30da7a1d1acf842e987bd76bc55800c9697dbd43aef1262f2",
      "text": "咦，那栋楼是……\n难道说，是指有电视台进驻的那栋大楼～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b9e258b078077e2201a84ad9f4d1147a57bf5ca2215848f833eeb74c99c5741",
      "text": "是的。莫非，\n您也打算走那条路吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53c8106395c795cf7a21e12f1ebc0c1726b941bd46d9e7f682a079bb04d8e1c3",
      "text": "嗯，克里斯先生也是啊～\n我们都没被卷进那起事故真是太好了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5956c7872a60351b37dd953d0c750100fbeb76d251404af0e4b686e0f4d5b4ab",
      "text": "在来这里的路上，发生了什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
